PALS1 and PATJ (By similarity). Interacts (via N-terminus) with PALS1/PALS (via PDZ domain) (PubMed:11927608, PubMed:12527193). As part of the Crumbs complex; interacts with WWP1, the interaction is enhanced by AMOTL2 and facilitates WWP1 localization to the plasma membrane (PubMed:34404733). The Crumbs complex promotes monoubiquitination of AMOTL2 by WWP1, which activates the Hippo signaling pathway (PubMed:34404733). Interacts with TJP3/ZO-3 and CLDN1/claudin-1 (PubMed:12021270). Interacts with ASIC3, KCNJ10, KCNJ15, GRIN2A, GRIN2B, GRIN2C, GRIN2D, NLGN2, HTR2A and SLC6A4 (By similarity). Interacts with MPP7 (PubMed:12021270). Directly interacts with HTR4 (By similarity). Interacts (via PDZ domain 8) with WWC1 (via the ADDV motif) (PubMed:18596123). Interacts with SLC6A4 (By similarity). Interacts (via C-terminus) with ARHGEF18 (PubMed:22006950). Interacts with NPHP1 (PubMed:19755384). Interacts with PARD3/PAR3 (By similarity). Interacts (via PDZ1-6 domains) with TJP1/ZO1; the interaction is required for attachment and extension of TJP1/ZO1 condensates along the apical cell interface (By similarity)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q8NI35-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":1582,"transcripts":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,1459],[1490,1460,93]],"edits":[{"start":1459,"end":1459,"original":"L","replacement":"LFWRLGSPRAWSQHLVRAFMLHHPVTEVEGQ","added":31},{"start":1553,"end":1801,"original":"NGSGVFISDIVKGGAADLDGRLIQGDQILSVNGEDMRNAS","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":249,"replaced":0,"novel":30,"foldedAbsent":145,"foldedMissing":145,"features":[[16,63,0],[17,87,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q8NI35-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q8NI35-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":59.7,"plddt":[[0,2],[50,2],[70,55],[50,1],[70,2],[50,5],[0,1],[50,2],[0,3],[50,3],[0,1],[50,1],[0,1],[50,1],[0,1],[50,1],[0,1],[50,3],[0,29],[50,2],[70,16],[90,2],[70,5],[50,3],[70,3],[